WEBVTT

00:50:30.163 --> 00:50:34.413
people do experience that in a in a like,
well, what's the message of wild?

00:50:34.454 --> 00:50:37.829
I'm like, oh, you know, the message
is whatever you think,

00:50:38.163 --> 00:50:40.454
whatever truth you find in yourself
when you read it.

00:50:40.746 --> 00:50:44.454
That's what I meant when books were my
religion as I felt saved by them,

00:50:44.454 --> 00:50:50.746
like I felt seen by them. So, you know, to
me, I've always said, like in airports,

00:50:50.829 --> 00:50:54.663
there are many of these kind of
little convenience stores

00:50:54.663 --> 00:50:58.413
and airports will have these little
turnstiles that are there,

00:50:58.413 --> 00:51:03.246
like inspirational or self-help like that.
And there are never books.